%% Source: docs/blueprint/BP-04-adapter-contract.md
%% Diagram: Adapter Contract Flow

sequenceDiagram
    participant Coordinator as Pipeline coordinator
    participant Adapter
    participant Watcher as File watcher
    participant Store

    Coordinator->>Adapter: detect()
    Adapter-->>Coordinator: boolean
    Coordinator->>Adapter: watchPaths()
    Adapter-->>Coordinator: string[]
    Coordinator->>Watcher: register adapter paths

    Note over Adapter: Adapter owns change detection, deterministic IDs,<br/>compaction splitting, sub-agent detection,<br/>git resolution, tool-call extraction, thinking extraction

    Watcher->>Coordinator: startup-scan | fs-change | periodic-scan
    Coordinator->>Adapter: findChanged(hint?)
    Adapter-->>Coordinator: ConversationRef[]

    loop each changed ref
        Coordinator->>Adapter: loadConversation(ref)
        Adapter-->>Coordinator: ConversationBundle | null
        Coordinator->>Store: writeBundle(bundle)
    end

    Note over Coordinator,Store: Pipeline owns watching, store writes, routing, push scheduling, and sink delivery
